  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horezm Wastewater Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of a sovereign loan of up to US$ 90 million (&#x20ac;80.3 million) to  the Republic of Uzbekistan for the benefit of the Limited Liability Company  Xorazm Suv Ta&apos;minoti, formerly known as State Unitary Enterprise Horezm  Suvokova (the &quot;Company&quot;) to finance the rehabilitation of Horezm Oblast&apos;s  wastewater infrastructure (the &quot;Project&quot;) under the Integrated Cultural  Heritage Framework (the &quot;Framework&quot;).  The project is expected to increase the number of people connected to the  wastewater network by 121,000, and the volume of wastewater treated to EU  standards by 4.8 million m3 per year.</narrative>
  </description>
